{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y在S01、S05等停留仅18—19秒的段落里，未延时出现的感受仍偏密，边听边扫时不如X容易迅速读完。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"X的左侧叙事集中，扫完整段更省力，但右侧短词容易成为零散印象；Y把关键心理变化放大加亮，并将感受穿插在相应情节附近，即使跳读也更容易抓住每段的转折及其原因。Y反复呼应靠近、害怕失去、收住喜欢、终于不再隐藏这条变化线，配合随音乐到时出现的具体身体感受和意象，让前后更像同一段经历，情绪也更有层次。Y的问题不是字多本身，而是少数短屏里同时可见的内容确实会争夺注意力。\"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4b1c7234-0b86-4529-9b71-34ca215ea4b3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T041342668528Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:14:22.803346+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8dffddf8f6f4ce247def57c2f40aa09e887cf9fc16046470cefe0bf3fff0fdc6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a737